  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive, Competitive and Responsible Digital Philippines - Digital-PINAS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Inclusive, Competitive and Responsible Digital Philippines (Digital PINAS) aims to leverage digital innovation for inclusive growth and resilience, aligning with UN frameworks and SDGs. It addresses digital disparities among marginalized groups through a three-pillar strategy: enhancing MSME capabilities, improving digital access, and fostering gender-responsive policies. Expected outcomes by 2027 include enhanced MSME digital capabilities, improved access to digital services for entrepreneurs, and gender responsive regulatory environment.</narrative>
  </description>
